# Benchmarks

A performance claim needs a JSON run: title id, machine, backend, resolution, upscaler, firstRun, avg FPS, p1, hitchCount.

- Same scene and duration as `benchmark.route` in the title profile.
- Steam overlay off. Compare warm caches to warm caches.
- Put raw runs in `tools/benchmark/results/` (gitignored). Commit only fixtures/samples.
- Hitch = frame time ≥ 2× median. First-run compiles are allowed; second launch must meet `docs/TELEMETRY.md`.
